futural.jhf: Hershey "simplex roman" vector font, from https://github.com/kamalmostafa/hershey-fonts

The Hershey Fonts were originally created by Dr. A. V. Hershey while working at the
U. S. National Bureau of Standards. The format of the font data was converted by
James Hurt (Cognition, Inc.). Use of the fonts is permitted provided this
attribution is retained.
